	(text_box "======================\nBoost Design Equations\n======================\nD = 1 - Vin/Vo\nRo = Vo^2/Po\nIin = Po/(eta*Vin)\ndelta_IL = 30% of Iin\nL_min = Vin*D*T/delta_IL\nLcrit = Ro*T*(1-D)^2*D/2\nILmax = Iin + 0.5*delta_IL\nILmin = Iin - 0.5*delta_IL\ndelta_Vc = 2%*Vo\nC = Vo*D*T/(Ro*delta_Vc)\nGlobal Constants:\nVin_min = 7.5V, Vin_nom = 11.1V, Vin_max = 12.6V\nVo = 24V\nfsw = 1MHz, T = 1us\neta = 0.9\ndelta_Vc = 2%*24 = 0.48V\nPo_max = 8.35W  (PT + solenoids + hall + buck converters)\nPo_ccm = 1.35W  (buck converters only, peripherals off)\nPo_min = 0.3W   (absolute minimum)\n\n================\n24V Boost\n================\nRfreq = 51kOhm -> fsw = 2MHz; use 80kOhm -> 1MHz\n\nCase 1: Po=8.35W, Vin=7.5V  [max load, min Vin]\nD = 1 - 7.5/24 = 0.6875\nIin = 8.35/(0.9*7.5) = 1.237A\nL_min = 7.5*0.6875*1*10^-6/0.371 = 13.9uH\nLcrit = (24^2/8.35)*1*10^-6*(0.3125)^2*0.6875/2 = 2.31uH\n\nCase 2: Po=1.35W, Vin=12.6V  [CCM boundary case]\nD = 1 - 12.6/24 = 0.475\nIin = 1.35/(0.9*12.6) = 0.119A\nLcrit = (24^2/1.35)*1*10^-6*(0.525)^2*0.475/2 = 27.93uH  [L must exceed for CCM]\n\nCase 3: Po=0.3W, Vin=12.6V  [absolute minimum]\nLcrit = (24^2/0.3)*1*10^-6*(0.525)^2*0.475/2 = 125.7uH\n\nChose 47uH (SRR1260A-470M), Isat=2.5A, Irms=2.6A, DCR=86mOhm, tol=+/-20%\n[Upper bound of TPS61175 recommended range 4.7-47uH]\n\nCase 1: Po=8.35W, Vin=7.5V\ndelta_IL_max = 7.5*0.6875/(1*10^6*0.8*47*10^-6) = 0.137A\nILmax = 1.237 + 0.5*0.137 = 1.306A  [< Isat=2.5A]\nILmin = 1.237 - 0.5*0.137 = 1.168A\n\nCase 2: Po=1.35W, Vin=12.6V\ndelta_IL_max = 12.6*0.475/(1*10^6*0.8*47*10^-6) = 0.159A\nILmax = 0.119 + 0.5*0.159 = 0.199A  [< Isat=2.5A]\nILmin = 0.119 - 0.5*0.159 = 0.040A  [CCM confirmed at worst-case tolerance]\n\nCase 3: Po=0.3W, Vin=12.6V\nILmin = 0.026 - 0.5*0.159 = -0.053A  [DCM]\n\nOutput Capacitor sized from Case 1:\nC_min = 24*0.6875*1*10^-6/((24^2/8.35)*0.48) = 498nF\nUsing 2x10uF ceramic = 20uF\ndelta_Vc_actual = 24*0.6875*1*10^-6/((24^2/8.35)*20*10^-6) = 11.9mV = 0.050% Vo\n\n=====================\nResponce Compensation\n=====================\nGiven:\nRo = 24^2/8.35 = 68.98 Ohm\nD = 1 - 11.1/24 = 0.5375\nL = 47uH, C_out = 20uF ceramic, RSENSE = 40mOhm (internal)\nGEA = 340 umho, REA = 10MOhm (from datasheet)\nR1 (R24) = 220k, R2 (R25) = 12k\n\nStep 1: Key frequencies\nfRHPZ = (Ro/2*pi*L)*(Vin/Vo)^2 = (68.98/2*pi*47*10^-6)*(11.1/24)^2 = 50kHz\nfP    = 2/(2*pi*Ro*Cout) = 2/(2*pi*68.98*20*10^-6) = 231Hz\n\nStep 2: Choose crossover fC\nfC <= min(fsw/5, fRHPZ/3) = min(240kHz, 16.7kHz)\nfC = 10kHz  [conservative, well below RHPZ]\n\nStep 3: Power stage gain at fC\nGPS_DC = Ro*(1-D)/(2*RSENSE) = 68.98*0.4625/0.08 = 398.6\nKPW(fC) = GPS_DC * (fP/fC) = 398.6 * (231/10000) = 9.21\n\nStep 4: R3 (R23) for unity loop gain at fC\nKCOMP = 1/KPW = 1/9.21 = 0.1086\nKCOMP = GEA * R3 * R2/(R1+R2)\nRcomp = 0.1086 / (340*10^-6 * 12000/232000) = 6.17kOhm (CHOSE 6.2K)\n\nStep 5: C4 (C36) for zero at fC/10 = 1kHz\nfZ = 1/(2*pi*R3*C4)\nCcomp = 1/(2*pi*6200*1000) = 25.7nF (CHOSE 33nF)\n\nVerification:\nfZ  = 1/(2*pi*6200*27*10^-9) = 951Hz  ~ fC/10 ok\nfP1 = 1/(2*pi*REA*C4) = 1/(2*pi*10*10^6*27*10^-9) = 590Hz\nPhase margin ~ 45 degrees\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at -93.5228 9.9568 0)
		(size 92.0242 202.7428)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cee6f456-0141-43f7-ae81-772523dc20e7")
	)
	(text_box "======================\nBuck Design Equations\n======================\nD = Vo/Vin\nLcrit = 0.5*(1-D)*R*T\nL = Vo*(1-D) / (fsw * delta_IL)\ndelta_IL = 60% of Io\nILmax = Io + 0.5*delta_IL\nILmin = Io - 0.5*delta_IL\nC = delta_IL / (8 * fsw * delta_Vo)\ndelta_Vo = 2% of Vo\nGlobal Constants:\nfsw = 500kHz\nT = 2us\n\n==============\n3.3V Regulator\n==============\nConstants:\nVin = 24V, Vout = 3.3V\nD = 3.3/24 = 0.1375\n\nPower cases:\nPo = 0.3W  ->  Io = 0.091A  ->  Lcrit = 32uH\nPo = 1.35W ->  Io = 0.409A  ->  Lcrit = 7uH\n\nDesign at Po = 1.35W:\ndelta_IL = 0.6*0.409 = 0.245A\nL = 3.3*(1-0.1375)/(500000*0.245) = 24uH\n\nChose 22uH (SRR1260A-220M), Isat=4A, Irms=3.6A, tol=+/-20%\ndelta_IL_max = 3.3*(1-0.1375)/(500000*0.8*22*10^-6) = 0.32A\nILmax = 0.409 + 0.5*0.32 = 0.569A\n\ndelta_Vo = 2%*3.3 = 0.066V\nC_min = 0.32/(8*500000*0.066) = 1.2uF\nUsing 2x10uF ceramic = 20uF\ndelta_Vo_actual = 0.264/(8*500000*20*10^-6) = 3.3mV = 0.10% Vout\n\n=================\n5 Volts Regulator\n=================\nConstants:\nVin = 24V, Vout = 5V\nD = 5/24 = 0.2083\n\nPower cases:\nPo = 0.2W ->  Io = 0.04A  ->  Lcrit = 99uH\nPo = 1.0W ->  Io = 0.20A  ->  Lcrit = 20uH\n\nDesign at Po = 1.0W:\ndelta_IL = 0.6*0.20 = 0.12A\nL = 5*(1-0.2083)/(500000*0.12) = 66uH\n\nChose 68uH (SRR1260A-680M), Isat=2.1A, Irms=2.1A, tol=+/-20%\ndelta_IL_max = 5*(1-0.2083)/(500000*0.8*68*10^-6) = 0.146A\nILmax = 0.20 + 0.5*0.146 = 0.273A\n\ndelta_Vo = 2%*5 = 0.1V\nC_min = 0.146/(8*500000*0.1) = 0.365uF\nUsing 2x10uF ceramic = 20uF\ndelta_Vo_actual = 0.146/(8*500000*20*10^-6) = 1.8mV = 0.037% Vout"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 425.8564 10.0584 0)
		(size 77.6478 129.8956)
